confirm-promote = Promote this sandbox over its original scene? The replaced files are kept in recovery.
about-body = Scene Editor manages templates, scenes and panel layout through the native Bus. Source files open in Ced. Scene loading, validation and recovery remain in the scene service.
shortcut-body = Ctrl+R — Refresh
    Ctrl+O — Edit scene in Ced
    Ctrl+Shift+O — Edit behaviour in Ced
    Ctrl+1 / 2 / 3 — Gallery / Installed / Arrange
    Ctrl+Q — Quit
    F1 — Keyboard shortcuts
    F10 — Activate menus
    Alt+F / E / S / A / V / H — Open a menu
    Arrows, Enter — Navigate menus
    Escape — Close menu or dialogue
